joa_tutorial_lightning_kb_short.message:
[I=hud_element_lightning,1] #element_lightning;
- Conjure #element_lightning; by pressing [K=lightning].
- Press [K=spell_aoe] near the machines up ahead to zap both simultaneously.

joa_tutorial_life_gp_short.message:
[I=hud_element_life,1] #element_life;
- To [c]heal yourself[/c], conjure #element_life; by pressing [K=life].
- [c]Press and hold[/c] [K=spell_self] until you're back to full health!

joa_1_1_1_popup3_kb.message:
[I=hud_element_earth,1] #element_earth;
In its basic form, this element sends rock projectiles through the air and makes the ground rumble. Combined with other elements, #element_earth; lets you create barriers, explosive projectiles and armor to protect against enemy blades.

Conjure #element_earth; by pressing [K=earth]. Then, press and hold [K=spell_forward]. The longer you charge it, the faster it will fly when you release [K=spell_forward]! Be careful: rock projectiles can ricochet!

joa_1_1_1_popup3_gp.message:
[I=hud_element_earth,1] #element_earth;
In its basic form, this element sends rock projectiles through the air and makes the ground rumble. Combined with other elements, #element_earth; lets you create barriers, explosive projectiles and armor to protect against enemy blades.

Conjure #element_earth; by pressing [K=earth]. Then, aim in the desired direction using [K=spell_forward]. The longer you aim, the faster it will fly when you let go! Be careful: rock projectiles can ricochet!

joa_1_1_2_popup7kb.message:
[I=hud_element_arcane,1] #element_arcane;
This element is much like #element_life;, but on the other end of the spectrum. It harms the living and heals the dead. Like #element_life; it can turn spells into beams, which enables you to pick off monsters and Goblins from afar.

Conjure some #element_arcane; elements by pressing [K=arcane] a few times. Then, aim with your mouse and press and hold [K=spell_forward] to shoot a beam!

