joa_1_1_1_popup5_kb.message:
[I=hud_element_shield,1] #element_shield;
On its own, a #element_shield; can form a protective barrier either all around you, in front of you, or just around your skin.

To [c]cover yourself in a protective shield[/c], conjure one #element_shield; by pressing [K=shield], and then cast it on yourself by pressing [K=spell_self]. If you succeed, you'll be surrounded by a glowing yellow shield!

joa_tutorial_fire_gp_short.message:
